# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Vite only exposes vars prefixed with VITE_.
# `.env` is gitignored — never put a real key in THIS file, it is committed.

# --- Contact form -------------------------------------------------------------
# Without this the contact form is DISABLED and says so on the page. It will not
# pretend to send. Get a free key (no server needed, delivers straight to an
# inbox) at https://web3forms.com — enter the office email, copy the key here.
#
# For production: set this in your host's environment settings (Vercel →
# Settings → Environment Variables), not in the repo. Vite inlines VITE_* vars
# into the client bundle at build time, so the build needs it present.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
